qbz (2.1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian/Launchpad PPA packaging, built on top of upstream's
    2.1.2 Qt6/QML rewrite (crates/Cargo.toml workspace version). Two
    binary packages: qbz (GUI) and qbzd (headless daemon, also bundled
    inside qbz). Targets Ubuntu resolute (26.04) and newer only — Qt
    >= 6.8 is required (QtQuick.Effects, Image.retainWhileLoading) and
    is not available in Ubuntu 24.04 LTS's archive.

 -- Édouard Biton <aarklendoia@proton.me>  Tue, 22 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
